{"text": "JOURNAL\nMeriden, .Conn.\nOctober 19, 1963\n\nCigarettes Under The Counter\n\n\u2018The controversial\u2019 cigarette \u2014\ndoes it cause lung cancer or\ndoesn't it? \u2014 has gone under the\n\u2018counter, But only on a limited\nscale.\n\u2018A drug store chain in Rochester,\nN:Y\u00a5. has removed all cigarettes\nfrom its counters and its reasoning\n\u2018goes like this: \u201cIt is inconsistent\nfor a company in business to serve\npeople with something apparently\nso harmful to them.\u2019\n\u2018The president of the Paine Drug\nCo. Philip \u00a5. Hahn, Jr., announced\n\u2018a few days ago that its seven stores\nim Rochester no longer will pro-\nmote any cigarettes in the stores\nnor will cigarettes be included in\nthe company\u2019s advertising.\nHahn goes a bit further. He says\nhhe would \u201clike to downgrade them\nand discourage cigarette sales\ncompletely.\u201d He made it clea\nhowever, that his stores wills\ncigarettes on request. The various\nbrands will be available behind\nthe check-out counters and will be\nsold only when a customer asks\nfor them.\nHahn based his decision (9. put\n\u2018cigarettes under the rounter aire\nports from the American -Cancer\n\nSociety. the Roswell Park Memor-\nial Institute in Buffalo and olber\nscientific an\u00e9 medical groups as\n\u201coverwhelming evidence of the ef-\nfects of cigarette smoking on the\nheart and lungs.\n\u2018Meanwhile, George V. Alten,\npresident of the Tobacco Institute,\nin a speech delivered at the 3ist\nannual convention of the Retail\nTobacco Dealers of America sald\nthat \u201cthe case against smoking\nstill rests largely on  statis-\ntical studies whose meanings are\nquestioned by many leading medi-\ncal statisticians. \u2018Intensive clinical\nand laboratory research,\u201d he sald,\n\u201chas failed to provide verification\nnecessary to show a cause and ef-\n{ect role for smoking.\u201d\n\u2018Thus the true picture tends to be\nobscured in\u2019 the cross - fire of\nclaims, denials and \u2014counter-\nclaims. But there Is no doubt ax\nfar as the Paine Drug Co. ig con-\ncerned. If nothing else, Hahn\ndeserves praise and recognition for\naking a stand in the controversy\nand doing something about it \u2014\n\u2018even IC it hits him in the cash reg-\nister. \u2018This ix something that\nis hard to find these days.\n\n4025028806\n\nPRESS-SCIMITAR\nMemphis, Tenn.\nOctober 17, 1963\nChain in N. Y.\nQuits Pushing\nCigaret Sales\n\nROCHESTER, N. Y.\u2014A lo-\n\nmoved all cigarets from its\n\u2018counter displays Because it\n\u201citis Inconsistent for a\n\u2018Company in business to serve\nto be promoting\n\ni\n\ned ae\naA\nHil\nali\n\nRE\nl\n\nEA\n\nN\nJ\nN\ngg\n2\nN\nZ\n\nnaomi",
